            <ArticleTitle>Asthma admission rates show six-fold variation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Figures released this month show a six-fold variation in emergency admission rates due to asthma across England. The region with the highest admissions is North West England, where rates for asthma are 65 per cent higher than in the East, which has the lowest numbers.</AbstractText>
